### 1. No Body (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json
# Expect: 400 Bad Request -> {"error":{"message":"malformed JSON body or unknown field"}}


### 2. Wrong Content-Type (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: text/plain

{"area":"Bole","phone":"0911223344","dish_ids":["d1"]}
# Expect: 400 Bad Request


### 3. Extra Unknown Field (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "area": "Bole",
  "phone": "0911223344",
  "dish_ids": ["d1"],
  "discount": 50
}
# Expect: 400 Bad Request (Triggered by dec.DisallowUnknownFields())


### 4. Over-large Body (> 1MB) (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "area": "Bole",
  "phone": "0911223344",
  "dish_ids": ["d1"]
}
# Expect: 400 Bad Request (Triggered by http.MaxBytesReader)


### 5. Empty Dish List (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "area": "Bole",
  "phone": "0911223344",
  "dish_ids": []
}
# Expect: 400 Bad Request -> {"error":{"message":"dish_ids must not be empty"}}


### 6. Unknown Dish ID (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "area": "Bole",
  "phone": "0911223344",
  "dish_ids": ["d999"]
}
# Expect: 400 Bad Request -> {"error":{"message":"unknown dish d999"}}


### 7. Duplicated Dish ID (201 Created - Validly Priced Twice)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "area": "Bole",
  "phone": "0911223344",
  "dish_ids": ["d1", "d1"]
}
# Expect: 201 Created -> Prices 2 items of Doro Wat correctly


### 8. Unserved Delivery Area "Ayat" (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "area": "Ayat",
  "phone": "0911223344",
  "dish_ids": ["d1"]
}
# Expect: 400 Bad Request -> {"error":{"message":"we do not deliver to Ayat"}}